Third-party data

This license covers the source code and documentation written for this
project. It does not cover the third-party data distributed with the
repository, which keep the terms of their providers (see "Datos y creditos"
in README.md):

- backend/data/context/*/dss*.f32 are derived from Digitized Sky Survey
  plates. They are not in the public domain: they may be used freely for
  scientific, educational and non-profit purposes under the Creative Commons
  Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 license, and for-profit use is
  forbidden (https://archive.stsci.edu/publishing/data-use). The copyright
  holder of each plate is recorded in the optical.json next to it.
- backend/data/context/*/gaia.json hold sources from Gaia DR3 (ESA/Gaia/DPAC).
  Gaia data are distributed under the CC BY-NC 3.0 IGO license, which does not
  allow commercial use (https://www.cosmos.esa.int/web/gaia-users/license).
- The SPHEREx, 2MASS and WISE products under backend/data and the test
  fixtures come from the NASA/IPAC Infrared Science Archive and are used with
  the acknowledgments their projects ask for.
- frontend/src/features/sphere/assets/cielo-nasa-svs-4k.jpg is derived from
  NASA Scientific Visualization Studio's "Deep Star Maps 2020"
  (NASA/Goddard Space Flight Center Scientific Visualization Studio; Gaia DR2:
  ESA/Gaia/DPAC).
